Description: Linux desktop client for V2Ray-style links
 Linux desktop client for V2Ray-style links built with Python and PyQt6.
 Includes bundled Xray-core for normal operation and provides profile
 management, diagnostics, desktop proxy integration, local Traffic Monitor
 history, and an optional v2link-netmon helper service for advanced
 per-application tracking preparation.

